{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-12", "prepared_on": "2026-08-12", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-12</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Google's Gemini app surges to 1 billion users<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Gemini 應用程式用戶突破 10 億</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's Gemini app has surged past 1 billion users, with 63% talking directly to the assistant via voice and the app now generating more than 150 million images daily.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google Gemini 應用程式用戶數已突破 10 億，其中 63% 的用戶透過語音功能直接與助理對話，每天生成的圖片數量也超過 1.5 億張。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/11/googles-gemini-app-surges-to-one-billion-users/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Cisco Firewall DoS Vulnerability Under Active Exploitation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">思科防火牆阻斷服務漏洞遭到積極利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cisco disclosed a high-severity denial-of-service flaw (CVE-2026-20349) in the Remote Access SSL VPN service of its ASA and FTD firewalls, which unauthenticated attackers can exploit remotely to force a reload.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">思科公布高風險阻斷服務漏洞 CVE-2026-20349，影響採用 ASA 與 FTD 系統的防火牆設備，未經身分驗證的攻擊者可遠端觸發防火牆重新載入。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178061\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Microsoft Discloses 3 Zero-Days, One Already Exploited<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟公布3個零時差漏洞，其中一個已遭利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">In its August Patch Tuesday, Microsoft fixed 421 vulnerabilities and flagged CVE-2026-68820, an actively exploited Windows kernel-mode driver flaw that can be used to escalate privileges to SYSTEM.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟在8月例行更新中修補421個漏洞，其中已遭利用的CVE-2026-68820存在於Windows核心模式網路驅動程式，攻擊者可藉此將權限提升至SYSTEM層級。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178057\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic says it will watermark text generated by its AI models<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic宣布將為Claude生成的文字加上浮水印</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic will embed machine-readable watermarks in Claude-generated text and add C2PA provenance metadata to generated images and files, extending support to older models as well.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic將在Claude生成的文字中嵌入機器可讀的浮水印，並為生成的圖片與檔案加入符合C2PA標準的來源中繼資料，此機制也將擴及舊版模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/11/anthropic-says-it-will-watermark-text-generated-by-its-ai-models/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Brad Lightcap, OpenAI's longtime COO, is leaving to 'start something new'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI資深營運長Brad Lightcap離職，將另創新事業</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">One of OpenAI's longest-serving executives, former COO Brad Lightcap, is departing after eight years, telling staff he's excited to help advance the mission \"from a different vantage point.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI任職八年的資深主管、前營運長Brad Lightcap宣布離職，他向員工表示將從不同的角度繼續協助推動公司使命。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/11/brad-lightcap-openais-longtime-coo-is-leaving-to-start-something-new/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> General Catalyst leads $1.1B round into 2-month-old River AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">General Catalyst領投10.1億美元，投資僅成立兩個月的River AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">River AI, founded by xAI co-founder Igor Babuschkin, raised $1.1 billion just two months after launch, pursuing a vision for personal AI agents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">由xAI共同創辦人Igor Babuschkin創立的River AI，成立僅兩個月便募得11億美元，致力打造個人化AI代理人願景。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/11/general-catalyst-leads-1-1b-round-into-2-month-old-river-ai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> An unreleased Anthropic model made progress on one of math's biggest unsolved problems<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic未發布模型在數學百年難題黎曼猜想上取得進展</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic hasn't solved the 150-year-old Riemann hypothesis, but an unreleased model made more progress on the problem than researchers expected.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">儘管Anthropic尚未解開這個困擾數學界150多年的黎曼猜想，但其一款未發布的模型在此問題上取得了超乎預期的進展。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/11/an-unreleased-anthropic-model-made-progress-on-one-of-maths-biggest-unsolved-problems/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> A Zoom Screen-Sharing Bug Let Anyone Take Over Other Devices on a Call<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Zoom螢幕分享漏洞讓任何人都能接管通話中其他裝置</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Researchers say it took fewer than 20 prompts to a public AI tool to uncover a now-fixed flaw that let anyone on a Zoom call hijack another participant's device.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究人員表示，他們僅用不到20次公開AI工具的提示，就找出這個已修補的漏洞，讓Zoom通話中的任何人都能挾持其他參與者的裝置。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-zoom-screen-sharing-bug-let-anyone-take-over-other-devices-on-a-call/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Nvidia Open-Sources Nemotron 3.5 Lightning and Model Router Switchyard<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia開源Nemotron 3.5 Lightning及模型路由工具Switchyard</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia open-sourced its Nemotron 3.5 Lightning AI model for executing specific agent tasks, along with NeMo Switchyard, a routing tool that automatically picks the best model for a given job.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia開源AI模型Nemotron 3.5 Lightning，可供AI代理人執行特定工作，並推出模型路由工具NeMo Switchyard，能依工作內容自動選擇最適合的模型。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178054\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Spotify says it won't recommend music from 'AI Personas'<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Spotify宣布不再推薦「AI Persona」藝人的音樂</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Starting in mid-September, Spotify will add an \"AI Persona\" badge to artist profiles that don't represent a real person, and will exclude their music from algorithmic and personalized recommendations.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Spotify將從9月中起為不代表真人的藝人檔案加上「AI Persona」標籤，並將這些音樂排除在演算法與個人化推薦之外。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/entertainment/977815/spotify-ai-persona-label-recommendations\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}